WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:0
Gongzhu: play four hands; the top total wins.
♦J +100, ♠Q −100, hearts cost points, ♣10 doubles.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.100 line:0
West holds ♣2 and leads it;
players must follow the led suit.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:22.000 line:0
North follows with ♣4; East and South follow too.
♣8 is highest: East wins and leads next.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.750 line:0
East leads ♦2; South plays ♦J, West ♦10.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:35.999 line:0
North has diamonds and must follow:
♦K is highest and captures ♦J for +100.

00:00:35.999 --> 00:00:43.099 line:0
Fast-forward: a hand is scored after all 13 tricks;
the scoring cards you capture decide it.

00:00:43.099 --> 00:00:55.999 line:0
In hand one North takes ♦J and ♣10:
the sum doubles to +180.

00:00:55.999 --> 00:01:06.000 line:0
Four hands done: North leads with +140 and wins.
Scores may be negative; equal totals share the win.
